  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CYED - Education Technology Hub Accountable Grants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides an accountable grant that delivers the Education Technology Hub, a global programme supporting low- and middle-income countries to improve learning outcomes through evidence-based use of digital technology. The grant funds research studies, innovation pilots and technical assistance to partner governments and educational institutions. It also supports new workstreams such as the Artificial Intelligence Observatory and Action Lab, enabling decision-makers to access high-quality evidence and practical guidance for designing and scaling effective technology-enabled education initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
